-- Put in: StarterPlayer > StarterPlayerScripts
-- Settings like the hub screenshot, UI style like the Flamethrower - Monkey menu.
-- MONKEY HUB. Keys: M = menu, E = aimbot, F = ESP, G = fly, V = noclip, O = orbit camera, N = next target, P = previous target, Z = dash, Y = rewind, X (hold) = pause aim
-- v2.0: every loop runs inside pcall (errors land in menu > diagnostics). Tabs on top of the menu, right-click a row = favourite.
-- SAVING: menu > "save" > "save settings". Needs the server script (bottom of this file) as a Script in ServerScriptService.
--
-- SILENT AIM only PUBLISHES the target, it cannot hijack other scripts. In your own gun/tool
-- LocalScript, aim the shot like this instead of using mouse.Hit directly:
--   local pos = _G.SilentAimPosition and _G.SilentAimPosition() or mouse.Hit.Position
-- (or read player.SilentAimTarget.Value for the target part)
--
-- MULTI-TARGET: tap several players in the player list. The numbers show the order.
-- The first one is aimed at, when he dies it moves on to the next one automatically.

